1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,900
What if every AI system on Earth suddenly stopped?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,800
No warning. No countdown.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,900
Just one moment when the world's smartest machines went silent.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:15,200
At first, you'd notice missing chatbots, broken recommendations, and smarter tools going offline.

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:19,800
But the real disruption would be happening behind the scenes.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:25,200
Banks, hospitals, warehouses, and transport networks use AI for important decisions.

7
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:29,800
Some services would slow down. Others would need humans to take over.

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:34,800
Companies would scramble to restore manual workflows. Tasks that took seconds could take hours.

9
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:39,800
But most computers, electricity, and the internet would still work.

10
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:43,600
Here's the twist. AI disappearing wouldn't erase human knowledge.

11
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:46,900
Doctors could still diagnose. Engineers could still build.

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,800
We'd lose speed, not intelligence itself.

13
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,400
So would civilization collapse? Probably not.

14
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:59,600
But the shutdown would reveal something uncomfortable: how much of modern life we've already handed over to machines.
